### Passbolt benchmark key material — NEVER commit private keys ###
Passbolt/PassboltPackage/Sources/MockData/Fixtures/keys/*
!Passbolt/PassboltPackage/Sources/MockData/Fixtures/keys/README.md

### Passbolt benchmark run artifacts (keep baseline.json + history.jsonl) ###
Tools/benchmark/results/

### Passbolt benchmark fixtures — only `small` is committed.
### medium/large are large captures kept locally (regenerate from a capture).
Passbolt/PassboltPackage/Sources/MockData/Fixtures/Benchmark/medium/*
!Passbolt/PassboltPackage/Sources/MockData/Fixtures/Benchmark/medium/.gitkeep
Passbolt/PassboltPackage/Sources/MockData/Fixtures/Benchmark/large/*
!Passbolt/PassboltPackage/Sources/MockData/Fixtures/Benchmark/large/.gitkeep

### Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

### Passbolt benchmark baseline + history — machine-specific (CPU/clock/memory and
### even instruction counts differ across hardware/arch). Regenerate locally with
### `make benchmark_baseline`; do not commit a shared reference.
Tools/benchmark/baseline.json
Tools/benchmark/history.jsonl

